The app requests permissions only for features you choose to use. Granting a permission does not by itself mean that all content on your device is transmitted off your device. NotaPro does not collect or sell the content of your notes for advertising.
• Camera: to scan documents and attach images.
• Microphone: to record voice notes or use speech recognition; the relevant service may process the audio needed for the feature under its own policies.
• Location: for optional location-based reminders.
• Nearby devices: to share notes with another device when you initiate the action.
• Advertising and external services: AdMob and other providers may process the technical information needed to provide their services, under their own policies and the consent choices available to you. Android handles biometric authentication; NotaPro does not receive the system’s biometric templates.
